{"_doc":"GOLD element plan for the Wizz/Ryanair-style flight search results reference (Bulgarian, pink brand). Read like a person (Z pattern): frame → sections A-C → elements. Passes `node build/route.js --plan`. Boxes and crops = measure-ref build px (frame 1440). Brand pink (#f1007c/#d50f8d) has no SAP role — kept as component defaults, never painted.","frame":{"w":1440,"h":765,"breakpoint":"XL 1440","density":"Compact","floorplan":"List Report"},"sections":[{"id":"A","name":"Filter sidebar (left column)","describe":"A narrow left column. First a title \"Спирки\" (Stops) with a collapse arrow, under it 4 radio options each with a price under the label: Всички (selected), Директни, До 1 спирка, До 2 спирки. Below that a title \"Часове\" (Hours) with a collapse arrow, under it two labeled range sliders: Заминаване (with two time values above the track) and Връщане (same). Below that a \"Багаж\" (Baggage) title, cut off at the bottom of the frame.","box":[37,29,373,736],"layout":"column FIXED 373 wide, gap 24; each filter group = title row + gap 20 + its controls","sap":["Text (section titles)","Radio Button ×4 (Compact)","Text (price under each)","2 Slider ranges","Text (Baggage title)"]},{"id":"B","name":"Sort tabs (right column, top)","describe":"Three tabs side by side, left to right: \"Най-добро\" (bold, underlined, selected — with a price and duration under it), \"Най-евтино\" (with its own price/duration under it), \"Най-бързо\" (same). Far right, a filter/sort icon.","box":[439,14,904,83],"layout":"row: 3 tab items FILL (title + price/duration under each) · sort icon HUG at the far right","sap":["Icon Tab Bar (or Segmented Button) — 3 tabs","Text ×2 under each tab (price, duration)","Icon Button (sort/filter) far right"]},{"id":"C","name":"Flight result cards (right column, below tabs)","describe":"Two result cards, one under the other, same layout. Each card: a small pin/bookmark icon on the far left. Next to it, two flight legs stacked vertically (outbound, then return), separated by a thin line. Each leg, left to right: airline logo; departure time and airport code (bold); an arrow with the duration and \"Директен\" (direct) under it; arrival time and airport code (bold, orange on the outbound row); a row of 3 small icons (bag, no food, no refund) at the right edge of the leg. Below the two legs, a vertical divider, then on the far right the price in bold pink and an \"Избор\" (Select) primary button. Under each card, a small grey disclaimer line about extra agency fees.","box":[437,115,974,641],"layout":"row: pin icon HUG · 2 flight legs column FILL (each: airline logo, times+route, icons) · vertical divider · price+button column HUG on the far right — one card, then a second identical card below with gap 24; each card followed by its own disclaimer text line","sap":["Icon (pin/bookmark)","flight-leg row ×2 per card (logo, times, route arrow, direct label, 3 fee icons)","divider (vertical)","Text price (LargeText/Bold)","Button Primary (Избор)","Text (disclaimer, small, secondary)"],"recipe":"flight_result_card"}],"rows":[{"section":"A","element":"Stops title","kind":"text","text":"Спирки","style":"H5/Bold","role":"title_text"},{"section":"A","element":"Stops collapse icon","kind":"icon","icon":"navigation-down-arrow","meaning":"expand","role":"icon"},{"section":"A","element":"Radio Всички","kind":"component","component":"Radio Button","props":{"Selected":"True","Form Factor":"Compact"},"role":"selection_control","group":"stop-all"},{"section":"A","element":"Label Всички","kind":"text","text":"Всички","style":"MediumText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"body_text","group":"stop-all"},{"section":"A","element":"Radio Директни","kind":"component","component":"Radio Button","props":{"Selected":"False","Form Factor":"Compact"},"role":"selection_control","group":"stop-direct"},{"section":"A","element":"Label Директни","kind":"text","text":"Директни","style":"MediumText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"body_text","group":"stop-direct"},{"section":"A","element":"Price Директни","kind":"text","text":"от 365 €","style":"SmallText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"secondary_text","group":"stop-direct"},{"section":"A","element":"Radio До 1 спирка","kind":"component","component":"Radio Button","props":{"Selected":"False","Form Factor":"Compact"},"role":"selection_control","group":"stop-1"},{"section":"A","element":"Label До 1 спирка","kind":"text","text":"До 1 спирка","style":"MediumText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"body_text","group":"stop-1"},{"section":"A","element":"Price До 1 спирка","kind":"text","text":"от 191 €","style":"SmallText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"secondary_text","group":"stop-1"},{"section":"A","element":"Radio До 2 спирки","kind":"component","component":"Radio Button","props":{"Selected":"False","Form Factor":"Compact"},"role":"selection_control","group":"stop-2"},{"section":"A","element":"Label До 2 спирки","kind":"text","text":"До 2 спирки","style":"MediumText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"body_text","group":"stop-2"},{"section":"A","element":"Price До 2 спирки","kind":"text","text":"от 191 €","style":"SmallText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"secondary_text","group":"stop-2"},{"section":"A","element":"Hours title","kind":"text","text":"Часове","style":"H5/Bold","role":"title_text"},{"section":"A","element":"Hours collapse icon","kind":"icon","icon":"navigation-down-arrow","meaning":"expand","role":"icon"},{"section":"A","element":"Departure label","kind":"text","text":"Заминаване","style":"SmallText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"secondary_text","group":"hours-departure"},{"section":"A","element":"Departure range start","kind":"text","text":"06:00","style":"MediumText/LHAuto/Bold","role":"body_text","group":"hours-departure"},{"section":"A","element":"Departure range end","kind":"text","text":"21:00","style":"MediumText/LHAuto/Bold","role":"body_text","group":"hours-departure"},{"section":"A","element":"Departure slider","kind":"component","component":"Step Input","props":{},"group":"hours-departure"},{"section":"A","eleme